.TH "INSPEKT\-CLICK" "1" "2026\-04\-16" "Inspekt 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
inspekt\-click \- Click an element on the page by CSS selector.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\f[B]inspekt\f[R] \f[B]click\f[R] [\f[I]SELECTOR\f[R]]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Click an element on the page by CSS selector.
.PP
Supports different click types:
.IP \(bu 2
single: Normal left click (default)
.IP \(bu 2
double: Double\-click
.IP \(bu 2
right: Right\-click (context menu)
.PP
The special selector `$0' targets the element currently selected in
Chrome DevTools, enabling seamless DevTools integration.
.PP
The command waits for the element to be clickable and returns the
element\(cqs text content for verification.
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
\f[I]SELECTOR\f[R]
optional text argument
.SH EXAMPLES
.IP
.EX
inspekt click \(aqbutton.submit\(aq
inspekt click \(aq#login\-btn\(aq \-\-type double
inspekt click \(aq$0\(aq  # Click DevTools\-selected element
inspekt inspect \(dqbutton
inspekt click
.EE
